                            bio: "Dr. A. Shameem is a distinguished Professor at the AMET Business School, AMET University, with more than 45 years of rich academic and professional experience in management education. She has served in several leadership roles including Head of the Department, Dean and Placement Coordinator, and has been associated with reputed institutions in India and Abroad. She earned her Ph.D. in Management Studies from Aligarh Muslim University in collaboration with All India Management Association, and holds an MBA from Madurai Kamaraj University along with a PG Diploma in Management Research from AIMA–CME. Dr. Shameem has served as an Accredited Financial Education Resource Person for Securities and Exchange Board of India, conducting financial literacy programs for diverse groups. A widely recognized educator, she has received several prestigious honours including the MTC Global Outstanding Management Teacher Award (2019), Best Women Faculty Award (REAA 2019), and multiple Best Teacher Awards from AMET University. She has also served on the Board of Studies of Anna University and contributed to academic governance as an examiner, research guide, and project evaluator for leading universities. A prolific scholar, she has published more than 85 research articles, including 37 Scopus-indexed papers, delivered over 40 conference presentations, served as editor for Sage and IGI publications, and secured research and training grants from All India Council for Technical Education to support academic development and industry training initiatives."
